E1FB 270B             (    forth6809.asm):03088                     BEQ   ENDW
E1FD 3001             (    forth6809.asm):03089                     LEAX  1,X
E1FF 313F             (    forth6809.asm):03090                     LEAY  -1,Y
E201 5C               (    forth6809.asm):03091                     INCB
