E206 313F             (    forth6809.asm):03095                     LEAY  -1,Y
E208 3404             (    forth6809.asm):03096         ENDW:       PSHS  B                 ; Save the count. See bugfix: WORDW.3
E20A 1F10             (    forth6809.asm):03097                     TFR   X,D
